{"id": "59634", "title": "洛洛（兄妹）", "author": "弥雅", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 6, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/59/59634.htm", "intro": "属性分类：现代／校园故事／一般言情／正剧\r\n\r\n关键字：洛洛 　养成 　NP \r\n\r\n简介： \r\n16岁的少女洛洛 \r\n一次偶然间撞到哥哥和女人亲热 \r\n生活发生了巨大转变 \r\n原本亲密无间的哥哥们 \r\n霎时变得暧昧起来  \r\n每一次接触 每一次对视 味道都变得好奇怪 \r\n而且他们竟然还……", "base": "files/article/html/59/59634", "chapters": [{"title": "1-10", "file": "8699703.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-20", "file": "8699706.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-30", "file": "8699709.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-40", "file": "8699710.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-50", "file": "8699713.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-61", "file": "8699715.html", "available": false}]}